abstract: >-
  A versioned open-source research archive: eleven research reports, among them
  the paper Cevahir Zihin: a Living Evidence Mind (CEV-2026-11), a learning
  system with no neural network that keeps every relation as evidence per
  origin, reads it with one rule, learns at every moment and can retract one
  experience exactly; the implementation, reproducible experiments with their
  result rows, preserved negative results, and an open mind raised on public
  material only. The DOI above identifies all versions; the version DOI is
  recorded once this version is published. Reports are not peer reviewed. AI
  assistance was used in code, experiments and drafting.
